          "code": "VERIFY_IF_FEEDBACK_RECEIVED",
          "id": "1774001443553",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774001443554_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Task\nAnalyze the user's Feedback to determine how to update the Manager Notes for the process: {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.SelectedEmploymentProcess}}.\n\n### Context\n- Current Manager Notes: {{$context.$variables.managerNotes}}\n- User Feedback Received: {{$context.$nodes.CONFIRM_USER_APPROVAL.$feedbackRecieved}}\n\n### Logic Rules\n1. If the User Feedback is empty or \"doesnt exist\":\n   - Set cancelChanges = \"false\"\n   - Set editManagerNotes = \"true\"\n   - Set managerNotesToBeEdited = \"\"\n   - STOP and return output.\n\n2. Determine User Intent from Feedback:\n   - If the user wants to CANCEL the process: set cancelChanges = \"true\".\n   - If the user wants to REPLACE the notes entirely: set editManagerNotes = \"false\" and extract the new text into managerNotesToBeEdited.\n   - If the user wants to EDIT/APPEND to the notes: set editManagerNotes = \"true\" and extract the requested changes into managerNotesToBeEdited.\n\n\n### Output Instructions\nReturn response in valid JSON format using the schema below. Do not include markdown formatting or \"```json\".\n\n{\n    \"cancelChanges\": \"string\",\n    \"editManagerNotes\": \"string\",\n    \"managerNotesToBeEdited\": \"string\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"cancelChanges\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"editManagerNotes\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"managerNotesToBeEdited\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
