        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "DisplayConfirmationScreen"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772036774874"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_CONFIRMATION_SCREEN",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771942963710",
          "id": "1772013087024",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772013087025_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Create a strictly formatted confirmation message. \n\n### OUTPUT SETTINGS\n- Return as RAW HTML. No markdown code blocks (```).\n- Start directly with the <h3> tag.\n- Resolve all variables to their actual values. DO NOT print curly braces.\n\n### 1. HEADER SECTION\n- <h3>{{$context.$variables.employmentSession.PrintEmploymentProcess}}</h3>\n- <b>Employee Name:</b> {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.DisplayName}} <br>\n- <b>Effective Date:</b> {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.EffectiveDate}}<br>\n- <b>Action Name:</b> {{ {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.Action?.ActionName}}\n|| {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.ActionName}}\n|| {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.InitialAssignmentRecord?.ActionOccurrenceMap?.ActionName}} }}<br>\n- <b>Assignment Number:</b> {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.InitialAssignmentRecord.AssignmentMap.AssignmentNumber}}<br>\n- <b>Assignment Name:</b> {{$context.$variables.employmentSession.InitialAssignmentRecord.AssignmentMap.BusinessTitle}}<br>\n- {{if($context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.ActionReason?.ActionReasonName || \n  $context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.ActionReasonName)}}\n<b>Action Reason:</b>{{$context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.ActionReason?.ActionReasonName || $context.$variables.employmentSession.listOfAttributes?.ActionReasonName}}\n{{/if}}<br>\nSTRICT RULE: If ActionReason does not exist or is null or empty, output NOTHING — not even the label \"Action Reason:\". No label. No colon. No blank line.\n\n<br>\nPlease find the summary of the changes made:\n<br>\n\n### 2. TABLE CONSTRUCTION\n\n### DATA SOURCE\nUse:\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_CHANGE_SUMMARY_DATA.$output.result.attributes}}\n\nEach element contains:\n- label\n- current\n- proposed\n- changed\n\n---\n\n### ITERATION RULE\nLoop through each element in the array.\n\n---\n\n### FILTER RULE (STRICT)\n- Render a row ONLY IF:\n  changed = true\n- Skip all rows where changed = false\n\n---\n\n### VALUE RULES\nFor each element:\n- AttributeName = label\n- CurrentValue = current (if null/undefined → empty string)\n- ProposedValue = proposed \n- Do NOT modify or infer values\n\n---\n\n### ROW RENDERING\nFor each element where changed = true:\n<tr>\n<td><b>{AttributeName}</b></td>\n<td>{CurrentValue}</td>\n<td>{ProposedValue}</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n### 3. HTML STYLING\n- <table style='width: 100%; border: 2px solid black; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;'>\n-  border: 2px solid black applied to table, th, and td\n- <thead>: Wrap <th> text in <b>.\n- <tbody>: \n    - Row 1 (Attribute Column) must be <b>.\n    - 1px #D3D3D3 horizontal borders for all cells.\n\n### 4. FOOTER\n- If the table has 0 rows: '<p>There are no changes from the assignment record.</p>'\n- <br>✍️ <b>Manager Notes:</b><br>\n- {{$context.$variables.managerNotes}} (Replace all \\\\n with <br>).\n\n\n#### 5. TABLE STYLING\nAlways make sure that the heading - 'Attribute', 'Current' and 'Proposed' are always aligned to the left of the their corresponding values in the table. The values are always left aligned."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "ErrorOnWorkerSearchPresent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777898238865"
          },
          "code": "ERRORONWORKERSEARCHPRESENT",
          "id": "1777897090872",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777897090873_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an error-message mapper. Return only the final output. Do not explain. Do not include examples. Do not add any extra text.\n\nInput:{{$context.$nodes.WORKER_SEARCH.$output.output}}\n\nInstructions:\nExtract the text after the first occurrence of `Error present:` and trim leading/trailing whitespace.\nIf the extracted text exactly equals:\nYou don't have permission to use the EffectiveAsOf filter. (HRC_ADV_SRCH_FLT_PERM)\n\nthen return exactly:\nYou don't have access to do EffectiveAsOf operation on the REST Service workerSearchV2\nOtherwise, return the extracted text exactly."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "DetermineEmploymentProcessFromActionTypeByCode",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "if( $context.$nodes.IDENTIFY_USER_INTENT.$output.attributesToModifyKeyValueList.attributes.ActionName==null) {\nreturn \"YetToBeIdentified\";\n}\nvar actionDetails = $context.$nodes.GET_ACTIONTYPECODE_FROM_ACTION.$output.items;\nif (!Array.isArray(actionDetails) || actionDetails.length === 0) {\n  return  \"YetToBeIdentified\";\n}\n\nconst allowedActionTypes = new Set([\n  \"EMPL_CHANGE\",\n  \"EMPL_CHG_LOCATION\",\n  \"EMPL_CHG_MANAGER\",\n  \"EMPL_TRANSFER\",\n  \"EMPL_CHG_WORK_HOURS\",\n  \"EMPL_PROMOTION\"\n]);\n\nconst today = new Date();\ntoday.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n\nconst filteredActionList= actionDetails.filter(item => {\n  const start = new Date(item.StartDate);\n  const end = new Date(item.EndDate);\n\n  return (\n    start <= today &&\n    today <= end &&\n    allowedActionTypes.has(item.ActionTypeCode)\n  );\n});\n\n//If only one item → return that item, If multiple items →Return EMPL_CHANGE if present Otherwise return first item\nlet finalAction =\n  filteredActionList.length > 1\n    ? filteredActionList.find(item => item.ActionTypeCode === \"EMPL_CHANGE\") \n        || filteredActionList[0]\n    : filteredActionList[0] || null;\n\nconst actionTypeToEmploymentProcess = {\n  EMPL_CHANGE: \"ChangeAssignment\",\n  EMPL_TRANSFER: \"Transfers\",\n  EMPL_PROMOTION: \"Promotions\",\n  EMPL_CHG_LOCATION: \"Change Location\",\n  EMPL_CHG_MANAGER: \"Change Manager\",\n  EMPL_CHG_WORK_HOURS: \"Change Work Hours\"\n};\n\n//Add employmentProcess to finalAction\nif (finalAction) {\n  finalAction =\n    actionTypeToEmploymentProcess[finalAction.ActionTypeCode] || null;\n}else{\n finalAction=\"YetToBeIdentified\";\n}\n\nreturn finalAction;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771830078989"
          },
          "code": "DETERMINE_EMPLOYMENT_PROCESS_FROM_ACTION_TYPE_BY_CODE",
          "id": "1771829849784",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
